<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 152 0 R
/T (Players incarnate a different person on each level, explore the level to collect sound notes and complete the Music available in the current level. The game has 3 loops :  Explore the map level to collect fragments of notes to further complement the music. Defeat the monsters hiding around the map mimicking sound sources and collect the musical notes they have stolen. Completely unlock the Music of the Level by Defeating all the monsters plus the boss, and collecting all the fragments of notes spread and hidden around the map.)
/E (Players incarnate a different person on each level, explore the level to collect sound notes and complete the Music available in the current level. The game has 3 loops :  Explore the map level to collect fragments of notes to further complement the music. Defeat the monsters hiding around the map mimicking sound sources and collect the musical notes they have stolen. Completely unlock the Music of the Level by Defeating all the monsters plus the boss, and collecting all the fragments of notes spread and hidden around the map.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
