273 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 153 0 R
/T (Everything is about living the experience of synesthesia, *visual and audio are critical*, the world is in grey scale by default and the surrounding of the player is only colorful within a small radius. Acting as a trigger is *Sound notes* forming a Music that increases said radius gradually until a *complete Music* is played and the radius covers the whole levels, making it possible to experience the level once more in its *vibrant nature instead of grey scale*. As a *rhythm game, music is crucial and so it has to be unique to the game and **adapted to the experience*.)
/E (Everything is about living the experience of synesthesia, *visual and audio are critical*, the world is in grey scale by default and the surrounding of the player is only colorful within a small radius. Acting as a trigger is *Sound notes* forming a Music that increases said radius gradually until a *complete Music* is played and the radius covers the whole levels, making it possible to experience the level once more in its *vibrant nature instead of grey scale*. As a *rhythm game, music is crucial and so it has to be unique to the game and **adapted to the experience*.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
